+          <h2>
+            <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
+              Should cats drink milk?
+              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+            </button>
+          </h2>
+          <div class="details">
+            <p>
+              Many cats are lactose intolerant, so milk can upset their stomachs. Fresh water is
