<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Cat FAQ</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --bg: #080b12;
        --panel: #121827;
        --panel-strong: #1a2335;
        --text: #f4f7fb;
        --muted: #bcc8d8;
        --accent: #84d9ff;
        --accent-strong: #b98cff;
        --border: #2b3953;
        --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        min-width: 320px;
        margin: 0;
        font-family:
          Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
          "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--text);
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(132, 217, 255, 0.18), transparent 30rem),
          radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(185, 140, 255, 0.16), transparent 28rem),
          var(--bg);
      }

      .skip-link {
        position: absolute;
        left: 1rem;
        top: 1rem;
        z-index: 10;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        color: #031019;
        background: var(--accent);
        border-radius: 999px;
        transform: translateY(-150%);
        transition: transform 160ms ease;
      }

      .skip-link:focus {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .page {
        width: min(100% - 2rem, 58rem);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 0;
      }

      header {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 7vw, 4.75rem);
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .intro {
        max-width: 42rem;
        margin: 1rem auto 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
      }

      .faq-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .example {
        overflow: hidden;
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        box-shadow: 0 1rem 2.5rem var(--shadow);
      }

      h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .question {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 3.5rem;
        padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
        color: var(--text);
        font: inherit;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: left;
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 0;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .question:hover {
        background: var(--panel-strong);
      }

      .question:focus-visible {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        outline: 0.2rem solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: -0.2rem;
      }

      .icon {
        display: grid;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        place-items: center;
        width: 2rem;
        height: 2rem;
        color: #031019;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-strong));
        border-radius: 50%;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .question[aria-expanded="true"] .icon {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
      }

      .details {
        padding: 0 1.4rem 1.35rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        background: rgba(18, 24, 39, 0.72);
      }

      .details p {
        margin: 0;
        padding-top: 1rem;
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
        .question,
        .icon {
          transition:
            background 160ms ease,
            transform 160ms ease;
        }
      }

      @media (forced-colors: active) {
        .example,
        .question,
        .details,
        .icon {
          border: 1px solid CanvasText;
        }

        .icon {
          color: ButtonText;
          background: ButtonFace;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>

    <main id="main-content" class="page">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Curious cat care</p>
        <h1>Cat FAQ</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          Quick answers to common questions about feline behavior, comfort, and everyday care.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="example">
          <h2>
            <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
              Why do cats purr?
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div class="details">
            <p>
              Cats often purr when they feel relaxed, but they may also purr to self-soothe,
              communicate, or recover from stress.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <h2>
            <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
              How much sleep do cats need?
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div class="details">
            <p>
              Most adult cats sleep about 12 to 16 hours a day. Kittens and senior cats may
              sleep even longer as their bodies grow or recover.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <h2>
            <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
              Why does my cat knead blankets?
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div class="details">
            <p>
              Kneading is a comforting behavior that begins in kittenhood. Many cats keep doing
              it when they feel safe, content, or ready to nap.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <h2>
            <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
              Should cats drink milk?
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div class="details">
            <p>
              Many cats are lactose intolerant, so milk can upset their stomachs. Fresh water is
              the best everyday drink.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <h2>
            <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
              How can I keep an indoor cat entertained?
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div class="details">
            <p>
              Offer climbing spaces, scratching posts, puzzle feeders, window views, and short
              daily play sessions that mimic stalking and chasing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script>
      document.querySelectorAll(".example").forEach((item) => {
        const button = item.querySelector(".question");
        const panel = item.querySelector(".details");

        button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
        panel.hidden = true;

        button.addEventListener("click", () => {
          const isExpanded = button.getAttribute("aria-expanded") === "true";
          button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(!isExpanded));
          panel.hidden = isExpanded;
        });

        button.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
          if (event.key === "Escape" && button.getAttribute("aria-expanded") === "true") {
            button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
            panel.hidden = true;
          }
        });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
